coreruleset source for Keel Linux
=================================

The repository follows DEP-14 as git-buildpackage repositories on salsa
do: upstream/latest holds the imported upstream tarballs, pristine-tar
their deltas, and keel/trixie this package.

The orig tarball is upstream's GitHub release archive of the LTS line:

  https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset/archive/refs/tags/v4.25.1.tar.gz
  coreruleset_4.25.1.orig.tar.gz
  sha256 0539e66e7627fe71c160a644d8fb7ab6e450d53c9de208be5f95a35c70e1a154

The regular expressions in rules/ are generated upstream from
regex-assembly/ by crs-toolchain, which is not in Debian; the package
ships the generated rules that upstream releases and tests.
